{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">市場評估能源價格走勢對金價的影響，金價變動不大，現貨金價窄幅上落。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紐約期金收市報4,376.4美元一盎司，跌7.5美元，跌幅百分之0.1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T22:59:18.898094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}